Hi,

This year's Joint PWG / OP Summit will again be hosted by Apple
in Cupertino, CA on 13-16 May 2014.

Please try to attend in person.

I'd like to extend a special invitation to OP Japan and OP Europe
members to take advantage of this opportunity to meet with many
printer vendors and hear the latest IPP and CUPS news in person.

Cheers,
- Ira (OP Chair)

